  m_Name: TutorialTopic_Towns
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Features.Tutorial.Data.TutorialTopicData
  <Title>k__BackingField: Towns
  <Chapters>k__BackingField:
  - <Title>k__BackingField: General
    <Description>k__BackingField: Towns are your way of winning games. You will trade
      with them, get them on your side, complete their missions and help them develop
      and prosper.
    <Image>k__BackingField: {fileID: 2800000, guid: c709834b8c40f154eadafcdd233b5c4f, type: 3}
  - <Title>k__BackingField: Reputation
    <Description>k__BackingField: 'Towns remember how you treat them. Their opinion
      of you changes with each trade and as you help them develop or choose to neglect
      them.

      Trades, constuction of buildings, failing or completing missions,
      among others all influence your reputation with towns.'
    <Image>k__BackingField: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 3f6c70e54ab649749a3a8ebbc3f2bdbf, type: 3}
